OL,3,APM to meet pub bombings families in new
OL,4,Ayear                                   
OL,6,FThe prime minister is to meet the      
OL,7,Ffamilies of people killed in the 1974  
OL,8,FBirmingham pub bombings as they        
OL,9,Fcontinue to call for a public inquiry. 
OL,11,FMP Liam Byrne and Richard Parker, the  
OL,12,FWest Midlands mayor, met Downing Street
OL,13,Fofficials this week to press for a date
OL,14,Ffor families to put their case to Andy 
OL,15,FBurnham.                               
OL,17,FBurnham has now confirmed in a letter  
OL,18,Fto Byrne that he will meet the families
OL,19,Fin Birmingham early in the new year.   
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
